{"title": "Broken Promises", "pageid": 6904, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Broken_Promises", "categories": ["Potions", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/e/e6/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Broken Promises image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Broken Promises</b> is one of <a href=\"/wiki/Ethel%27s_special_potions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ethel's special potions\">Ethel's special potions</a> that grants both a positive and harmful effect.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A parasite swims in the bottom of this bottle, fat with strength.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potions\" title=\"Potions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png/25px-Potions_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png/38px-Potions_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png/50px-Potions_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Potions\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png/25px-Potions_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potions\" title=\"Potions\">Potions</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-fe49ed74a326f9d0END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7f3c11eef8c8f658END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CONS_Hag_Broken_Promises</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:CONS_Hag_Broken_Promises\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:CONS_Hag_Broken_Promises\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">3575950d-c41a-448d-bb2d-cd08c78c88c6</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3575950d-c41a-448d-bb2d-cd08c78c88c6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3575950d-c41a-448d-bb2d-cd08c78c88c6\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Consume the potion to inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Broken_Promises_(Condition)\" title=\"Broken Promises (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Broken Promises\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Broken_Promises_(Condition)\" title=\"Broken Promises (Condition)\">Broken Promises</a> on yourself.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Broken_Promises\"> Condition: Broken Promises </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Broken_Promises_(Condition)\" title=\"Broken Promises (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Broken Promises\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/ELX_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Broken_Promises_(Condition)\" title=\"Broken Promises (Condition)\">Broken Promises</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> is increased by 2 until the next <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.</li>\n<li>Upon resting, Strength is indefinitely reduced by 1.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>At the end of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Overgrown_Tunnel\" title=\"Overgrown Tunnel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Overgrown Tunnel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Overgrown_Tunnel\" title=\"Overgrown Tunnel\">Overgrown Tunnel</a>, in the Acrid Workshop</li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This is the only potion in Auntie Ethel's workshop with a short-term benefit and long-term detriment.\n<ul><li>Attempting to use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Remove_Curse\" title=\"Remove Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/20px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/30px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/40px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Remove Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/20px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Remove_Curse\" title=\"Remove Curse\">Remove Curse</a> triggers the detriment immediately.</li>\n<li>This does not stack with items which set strength to a specific number, such as <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength\" title=\"Elixir of Hill Giant Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength\" title=\"Elixir of Hill Giant Strength\">Elixir of Hill Giant Strength</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>If the player character wants the potion's short-term benefit, its negative effect can be mitigated with the following strategies:\n<ul><li>Killing the character who consumed the potion (they must actually be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\">Dead</a> and not rolling death saves) and reviving them with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/38px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/50px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Withers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers</a> or a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Revivify\" title=\"Scroll of Revivify\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Revivify\" title=\"Scroll of Revivify\">Scroll of Revivify</a> removes the effect.\n<ul><li>However, this also removes certain other 'permanent' effects, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Loviatar%27s_Love_(Condition)\" title=\"Loviatar's Love (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loviatar's Love\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Loviatar%27s_Love_(Condition)\" title=\"Loviatar's Love (Condition)\">Loviatar's Love</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Respec with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/38px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/50px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Withers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers</a> into a build which does not utilize strength.</li>\n<li>Switch to the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Club_of_Hill_Giant_Strength\" title=\"Club of Hill Giant Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Club_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Club_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Club_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Club_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Club_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Club_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Club_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Club_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Club_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Club_of_Hill_Giant_Strength\" title=\"Club of Hill Giant Strength\">Club of Hill Giant Strength</a> as a main weapon.</li>\n<li>If one plans to take a story path which permanently removes one character from the party roster (such as sacrificing someone to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL\" title=\"BOOOAL\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/25px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/38px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/50px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"BOOOAL\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/25px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL\" title=\"BOOOAL\">BOOOAL</a>), this potion can be given to them.\n<ul><li>Similarly, the potion can be given to a <a href=\"/wiki/Hireling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hireling\">hireling</a> one plans to later dismiss.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Consume the potion after taking the final long rest at the end of the game.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Drinking the potion grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan#An_Acquired_Taste\" title=\"Guild Artisan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"An Acquired Taste\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan#An_Acquired_Taste\" title=\"Guild Artisan\">An Acquired Taste</a> to party members with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan\" title=\"Guild Artisan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/25px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/38px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/50px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guild Artisan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/25px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan\" title=\"Guild Artisan\">Guild Artisan</a> background.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201114\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.110 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.117 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5454/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 60769/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18547/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.043/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1597348/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   96.288      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   96.288      1 -total\n 36.29%   34.943     17 Template:Icon_text\n 32.96%   31.740     56 Template:Trim\n 20.58%   19.815     12 Template:Icon_link\n 16.92%   16.294      3 Template:SmRarityItem\n 16.28%   15.675      3 Template:SmCond\n 14.32%   13.78